# Every path, one owner.
#
# This repository currently lives under a personal account
# (sayandedotcom/ai-slack-bot), where CODEOWNERS has limited effect: GitHub
# does not request a review from the pull request's own author, so on a
# single-maintainer repository this file is documentation.
#
# It becomes load-bearing the moment the repository is transferred to an
# organisation and a ruleset enables "Require review from Code Owners".
# Landing it now means that transfer does not also need a policy decision.
*                                   @sayandedotcom

